<title>POLAND: POLIFARB- C JULY NET UP TO PLN 4.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB- C JULY NET UP TO PLN 4.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.93 vs   3.64</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.35 vs   7.37</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.44 vs   7.52</p>
<p> Sales		   38.91 vs  34.75</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    22.32 vs  12.04</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	35.59 vs  22.97</p>
<p> Operating profit    35.76 vs  24.13</p>
<p> Sales		  213.33 vs 182.23</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb Cieszyn</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
